OL,3,GNEWSASand shortage 'could affect home
OL,4,Abuilding plans'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build new homes in Lancashire
OL,7,Fcould be suffering - due to a shortage
OL,8,Fof raw materials such as sand and
OL,9,Fgravel, it has emerged.
OL,11,FApplications for new quarries or
OL,12,Fextensions to existing sites could be
OL,13,Fneeded to address the issue, a draft
OL,14,Fplanning document says.
OL,16,FExpected demand for the materials up
OL,17,Funtil 2042 is 11.56 million tonnes -
OL,18,Fcompared with 5.17 million tonnes of
OL,19,Fpermitted reserves - leaving a
OL,20,Fprojected shortfall of 6.39 million
OL,21,Ftonnes.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
