OL,3,GNEWSASand shortage 'could affect home
OL,4,Abuilding plans'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe draft Joint Lancashire Minerals and
OL,7,FWaste Local Plan describes a
OL,8,F"significant unmet need for sand and
OL,9,Fgravel now and throughout the plan
OL,10,Fperiod", but does not allocate any new
OL,11,Fextraction sites.
